// DRAFT (Act III, planning only). Ch18 K01 "Maiden flight" (C → P, 3 min). act3_ch18.md §2 K01.
// The hull lifts on Liss's held count: three held inputs, the bench rhythm again if ch11_lamp_repaired. Dace's sails
// fill: the flare-kite cut. Liss, at the wheel, says NOTHING for the whole lift; then one line, said after the lift
// (pillar 1: warmth between people, after the loss is seen). The hull-captains' current-song comes up from below.
// The Kite's lamps are bound light: still. Then first control of the Kite (the scene hands off to play).
title: ch18_maiden_flight
location: ch18/kite
---
@letterbox on
@camera K01
@music kite_theme fade=2.0
@mark liss kite_wheel walk
@wait 2.0
<<event hold_input lift_one>>
@vfx glimmer_bound at=kite_lamps count=6
@wait 2.5
<<event hold_input_end>>
<<event hold_input lift_two>>
@sfx sails_fill
@wait 2.5
<<event hold_input_end>>
<<event hold_input lift_three>>
@anim liss hold wheel
@wait 3.0
<<event hold_input_end>>
@camera K02
@sfx current_song at=flotilla vol=0.6
@wait 5.0
@camera K03
@anim liss look_at sails
@wait 3.0
Liss [soft_smile]: He'd have hated the trim. #line:ch18_flight_001
@wait 2.0
<<if $ch17_first_berth>>
    Rhen [soft_smile]: He'd have sung to it till it listened. #line:ch18_flight_002
<<endif>>
@wait 2.0
<<set $ch18_started = true>>
@letterbox off
===
